-- Every value is from Wall 11959, 11960, 11971 and 11975 (read whole by W3, 11959 in its first 2,200 characters), ask635/w4/plan635.md (rev 1, md5sum by W3; headings 1 to 4 read), audit_log row 42082 (read by W3), model_config read by W3 at 05:18 CST 2026-11-25 (hydrogen google/gemini-4-hydrogen 131072 active), the operator's message of 04:41 CST 2026-11-25 as relayed to W3 by the coordinator and recorded at Wall 11954, and W4's thread note to W3 of 05:19 CST (the card; kept in aar/w3/cards_629_635_from_w4.md).
